.TH SPARROWOS 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.5.2" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
sparrowos \- the fledgling: learns routine, pre-warms apps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sparrowos
.RI [ \-\-once | warm ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hourly census of CPU time per command name keeps the top-30
habits; at boot the top-5 known GUI binaries are read into page
cache. Small, learning to fly your routine. Placebo on SSDs,
mercy on hard drives. Named for the small-bird era.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR terrydavis (8)
